 "description": "Use this when the user wants to browse campaigns for one artist, optionally filtered by type or status. Do not use this for a single campaign deep dive; use dynamoi_get_campaign for that. Never use this to personalize generic marketing advice. If the user has no artists yet, do not call this \u2014 route via dynamoi_get_account_overview first.",
